#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0328-A expect=skipped domain=TE
#note "DISCRIMINATOR (R-5.26): both columns are present, so Requirements.Variables.None [TEDUR] is unmet and this sibling SKIPS even though row 2 leaves both blank - that record is the parent CDISC-CG0329's finding (CDISC-CG0328, its R-5.26 duplicate, is parked Not Executable per D-8), not this sibling's. The four states are disjoint: no dataset is reported by two members of the family."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TE label="Trial Elements"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col ETCD    type=Char label="Element Code"
col ELEMENT type=Char label="Description of Element"
col TESTRL  type=Char label="Rule for Start of Element"
col TEENRL  type=Char label="Rule for End of Element"
col TEDUR   type=Char label="Planned Duration of Element"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | TE | SCRN | Screening | Informed consent | End of screening | P14D
CDISCPILOT01 | TE | TRT | Treatment | First dose |  |
